Test of Eva requests; see file test_requests.ml for details.

Compilation of the test_requests.ml file.
  $ dune build --cache=disabled --root . _build/default/test_requests.cmxs

Load test_request and used plugins, and define shared options.
  $ alias frama-c="frama-c -no-autoload-plugins \
  >   -load-module server,eva,eva.server_api,inout,scope \
  >   -load-module test_requests.cmxs \
  >   -eva-verbose 0 -eva-warn-key alarm=inactive"

Test computationState after [compute] and [clear] requests.
  $ frama-c -test analysis
  [test] Request SET kernel.ast.setFiles [ stats.i ];
  [test] Request GET plugins.eva.analysis.getComputationState:
      not_computed
  [kernel] Parsing stats.i (no preprocessing)
  [test] Request EXEC plugins.eva.analysis.compute;
  [test] Request GET plugins.eva.analysis.getComputationState:
      computed
  [test] Request SET plugins.eva.analysis.clear;
  [test] Request GET plugins.eva.analysis.getComputationState:
      not_computed

